<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>《九門》慶功宴 | 陳偉霆資料庫</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <main>
      <a href="/timeline" class="back">← 返回時間線</a>
      <p class="site-identity">陳偉霆資料庫 · William Chan Archive</p>

      <header>
        <p class="event-date"><time datetime="2026-08-26">2026年8月26日</time></p>
        <h1>《九門》慶功宴</h1>
        <p class="category">活動</p>
      </header>

      <section aria-labelledby="activity-heading">
        <h2 id="activity-heading">基本活動資訊</h2>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>時間</dt><dd>約 18:00～18:30 開始</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="footer-inner">
        <p class="footer-title">陳偉霆資料庫 · William Chan Archive</p>
        <p class="footer-nav">Timeline ｜ Works ｜ People &amp; Characters ｜ Sources</p>
        <p>非官方粉絲資料庫</p>
        <p>本站內容僅作資料整理與記錄用途。</p>
        <p class="footer-copyright">© 2026 William Chan Archive</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>

  <style>
    :global(*) {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    :global(body) {
      margin: 0;
      background: #f8f6f3;
      color: #292624;
      font-family: "Noto Sans TC", "Noto Sans JP", Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    main {
      width: 88%;
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 50px 0 80px;
    }

    .back {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      color: #77706b;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .site-identity {
      margin: -18px 0 28px;
      color: #958d87;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }

    header {
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .event-date,
    .category {
      margin: 0;
      color: #77706b;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 8px 0 12px;
      font-size: 36px;
      line-height: 1.35;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    section {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 28px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e5e1dc;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    section h2 {
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    dl {
      margin: 0;
    }

    dl div {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 7rem 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 10px 0;
    }

    dt {
      color: #77706b;
    }

    dd {
      margin: 0;
      color: #4f4945;
    }

    .site-footer {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 32px 8%;
      background: #675f5a;
      border-top: 4px solid #d8d0ca;
      color: #e3ddd8;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .site-footer p {
      margin: 6px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .site-footer .footer-title {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #f5f1ee;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .footer-nav {
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .footer-copyright {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: #c6bdb7;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      main {
        padding: 30px 0 50px;
      }

      .back {
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      header {
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 28px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 20px;
      }

      dl div {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 4px;
      }

      .site-footer {
        margin-top: 10px;
        padding: 22px 6%;
      }

      .site-footer p {
        margin: 4px 0;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }
    }
  </style>
</html>
